tten%20Homework%204.pdf)\nDeadline source: [Canvas](https://canvas.oregonstate.edu/courses/2064169/assignments/10722784), verified 2026-11-06.\n\nStudy answers, explanations, and graphics labeled “Authored reference” are additions, not publisher-provided solutions.\n\n## Instructions\n\nProblems 1 and 2 concern material for Quiz 3; the instructor recommends completing them before that quiz. Preserve the verification, explanation, and proof requirements below. The Canvas deadline is November 13 at 11:59 p.m. PST; Gradescope also lists a late deadline of November 15 at 11:59 p.m. PST." 13194139546561 17592186502323 true] [17592186754759 1066 #uuid "c96620d6-0b00-5bb6-bb4f-d7400eff2f9b" 13194139546561 17592186502323 true] [17592186754759 1067 "Assignment information" 13194139546561 17592186502323 true] [17592186754760 1068 #edb/ref 17592186754745 13194139546561 17592186502323 true] [17592186754760 1071 "**(g)** $\\nabla\\cdot(\\nabla\\phi)$.\n\nClassification: {{answer}}." 13194139546561 17592186502323 true] [17592186754760 1072 #uuid "c97467fe-134c-5a91-badc-5c00d3887116" 13194139546561 17592186502323 true] [17592186754760 1074 "The inner gradient is a vector field, whose divergence is scalar." 13194139546561 17592186502323 true] [17592186754761 1058 #edb/ref 17592186754478 13194139546561 17592186502323 true] [17592186754761 1062 #uuid "ca3ccafc-5d8e-5b4e-93fa-e7287f0e26e3" 13194139546561 17592186502323 true] [17592186754761 1063 #edb/ref 17592186754443 13194139546561 17592186502323 true] [17592186754762 1080 "scalar function" 13194139546561 17592186502323 true] [17592186754762 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139546561 17592186502323 true] [17592186754762 1083 #uuid "ca76032a-ae1c-5688-867a-19c888420b47" 13194139546561 17592186502323 true] [17592186754763 1080 "vector field" 13194139546561 17592186502323 true] [17592186754763 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139546561 17592186502323 true] [17592186754763 1083 #uuid "cb69c1eb-85f1-54b1-8088-6c40afff1c6c" 13194139546